Features to investigate
- Native sndio backend
- Thread/process CPU times and memory counters.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:info kernel32:thread'
- CPU accounting, frequency and power.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:info kernel32:power'
- XSAVE/XSTATE and CPU contexts.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:exception'
- Hardware debug-register support.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:exception'
- Partial NtWriteVirtualMemory copies.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='kernel32:virtual'
- Working-set information (QueryWorkingSetEx).
  make retest TEST_SUITES='psapi:psapi_main'
- WOW64 registry views.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='advapi32:registry msi:action msi:install'
- FAT case sensitivity (needs a FAT-backed Wine temp directory).
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:directory kernel32:file'
- Persistent DOS attributes without xattrs.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntdll:directory ntdll:file scrrun:filesystem'
- Directory reparse points, junctions and custom tags.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='kernel32:file ntdll:file cmd.exe:batch'
- Removable devices (smoke tests need mapped removable media).
  make retest TEST_SUITES='kernel32:drive kernel32:volume'
- Serial port discovery (tests need an accessible COM port).
  make retest TEST_SUITES='kernel32:comm'
- IPv6 routes and source selection.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='iphlpapi:iphlpapi'
- TCP socket reuse and UDP disconnection.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ntoskrnl.exe:ntoskrnl ws2_32:sock'
- IPv4-mapped IPv6 and dual-stack sockets.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ws2_32:sock'
- Winsock options and multicast reception.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='ws2_32:sock wsdapi:discovery'
- Kerberos/GSSAPI via Heimdal.
  make retest TEST_SUITES='secur32:secur32'
- LEA + short %gs patching for mimalloc/bun (functional baseline, no benchmark)

Testing & fixes
- Broaden testing beyond games.
- Investigate test failures and hangs.
- Run tests on a desktop using a dedicated user

